  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.28": "时间：",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.281": "训练",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.282": "验证",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.283": "测试",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.284": "dspy.Prediction",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.285": "score",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.286": "feedback",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.287": "reasoning",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.288": "question",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.289": "q",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.29": "手动针对真实样例测试数十种措辞既耗费时间，又很难复现为什么选择了某个版本而不是另一个。",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.290": "pending",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.291": "running",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.292": "success",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.293": "failed",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.294": "cancelled",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.295": "auto=\"light\"",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.296": "num_threads",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.297": "Skynet 是一个用于优化提示词的服务。你无需猜测措辞再手动测试，而是上传一个数据集、定义一个指标、选择模型，然后 Skynet 搜索一个能返回更好答案的 DSPy 程序。在幕后，它使用 ",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.298": " 和优化器 ",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.299": "。",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.3": "调优 GEPA 与运行成本",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.30": "专业知识：",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.300": "import dspy\n\ndef score_answer(gold, pred, trace, pred_name, pred_trace):\n    \"\"\"Return a score and constructive feedback for the reflection LM.\"\"\"\n    expected = gold.answer.strip().lower()\n    actual = (pred.answer or \"\").strip().lower()\n\n    if expected == actual:\n        return dspy.Prediction(score=1.0, feedback=\"The answer matches the desired output.\")\n    if expected in actual:\n        return dspy.Prediction(\n            score=0.5,\n            feedback=f\"Partial answer. The desired output is {expected}, and we got {actual}.\",\n        )\n    return dspy.Prediction(\n        score=0.0,\n        feedback=f\"The answer does not match. The desired output is {expected}, and we got {actual}.\",\n    )\n",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.301": "validating",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.302": "：在运行开始前检查输入、代码、列映射和模型。",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.303": "只给出 0.30 分，却没有解释候选项为什么失败。",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.304": "只给出 0.50 分，却没有关于哪条指令起了作用的信息。",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.305": "只给出 0.40 分，却无法判断它对边缘情形是否有效。",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.306": "准备任务",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.307": "你定义一个输入、输出、数据集，以及一个代表真正成功的指标，而不仅仅是好看的措辞。",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.308": "运行优化",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.309": "你发送一个请求，跟踪状态和日志，并检查分数在运行过程中是否有所提升。",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.31": "你需要理解何时添加结构、何时要求逐步推理、何时要求 JSON，以及何时一条冗长的指令只会增加噪声。",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.310": "使用结果",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.311": "你在新输入上测试产物、下载程序，或通过服务端点运行它。",
  "auto.features.tutorial.components.concepts.guide.literal.312": "max_full_evals / max_metric_calls",
